### ==================== 变量 ====================
# 先用 loginTest.http 的用例1或2登录，拿到 token 替换下面
@token = REPLACE_ME_请粘贴登录token


### ==================== 正常发评论 ====================

### 1. 正常发评论（无父评论）
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "这是一条测试评论"
}


### 2. 正常回复评论（带 parentId）
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "这是一条回复",
  "parentId": 46
}


### ==================== 异常 — 鉴权 ====================

### 3. 缺少 token
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "未登录评论"
}


### 4. 伪造 token
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: fake-token-12345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "假 token 评论"
}


### ==================== 异常 — 参数缺失/非法 ====================

### 5. 缺少 contentId
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "没有 contentId"
}


### 6. 缺少 message
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### 7. message 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": ""
}


### 8. contentId 为不存在的值
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 99999,
  "message": "对不存在的内容的评论"
}


### ==================== 异常 — parentId 非法 ====================

### 9. parentId 指向不存在的评论
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "回复不存在的评论",
  "parentId": 99999
}


### 10. parentId 与 contentId 不匹配（父评论不属于该内容）
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "跨内容回复",
  "parentId": 5
}


### ==================== 异常 — 路由 ====================

### 11. 未识别的 action（POST）
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/unknown
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "test"
}


### ==================== 查询评论（GET /show）====================

### 12. 登录用户查询评论
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/show?contentId=1
token: {{token}}


### 13. 未登录用户查询评论
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/show?contentId=1


### 14. 查询不存在的内容的评论
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/show?contentId=99999
token: {{token}}


### ==================== 查询评论 — 异常 ====================

### 15. 缺少 contentId 参数
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/show
token: {{token}}


### 16. contentId 为非数字
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/show?contentId=abc
token: {{token}}


### 17. 缺少 action
GET http://localhost:8080/comment
token: {{token}}


### 18. 未识别的 action（GET）
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/unknown
token: {{token}}